  "metadata_appenditions": {
    "docs/cp7/d17-14/KOORDINASI.md": "\n\n## 4 Nov 2026 \u2014 A, penggabungan tema selesai ke kandidat mandor\n\nA menggabungkan tepat 79 berkas src dan satu fixture pembaca stok dari kandidat UI\n8678feba ke kandidat mandor 53123248. Tema B diteruskan; pembaca stok baru tetap\nmenampilkan kelengkapan HPP. App.tsx termasuk perubahan bersama oleh integrator.\nTidak ada perubahan SQL, hak transaksi, fixture keuangan, recovery atau workflow\naktif. Bukti visual donor dipakai hanya karena seluruh src dan input build sama;\nuji UI saat penggabungan terpisah dari penerimaan Afui/Mandor/SKU/Global.\n",
    "scripts/current-unified-candidate/READINESS.txt": "\n4 Nov 2026 \u2014 Reviewed theme and current stock reader integrated.\nThe previous paragraph describes the historical pre-theme composition. Current\nsrc exactly matches reviewed UI 8678feba/tree6ff52aa4 (79 changed source paths),\nplus its exact stock-reader fixture. The old component/UI receipts remain byte\nidentical and are checked through explicitly verified pre-theme presentation\nbytes; they do not claim current CSS is unchanged. All other Mandor preparation,\nSQL, rights, financial fixtures, recovery and workflows remain exact to 53123248.\nThe theme source fence checks every current src file separately. Previously\nretained visual receipts are donor fixture evidence, not connected ERP or current\nfinancial acceptance. Actual Afui15 and all-five full restoration still gate\nMandor17 admission; both runtime and production admission remain closed.\n"
  },
